# N-Methyl-2-pyrrolidone (NMP): gas-phase XTB2 Opt (no solvation)
#
# UPDATE: "ALPB(nmp)" was confirmed NOT to be a recognized ORCA keyword -
#   ORCA rejected the input outright ("UNRECOGNIZED OR DUPLICATED
#   KEYWORD(S) IN SIMPLE INPUT LINE: ALPB(NMP)"). Per the chosen fallback,
#   this run drops implicit solvation entirely and is a plain gas-phase
#   XTB2 optimization. The solvated reference for NMP comes from the
#   r2SCAN-3c/CPCM calculation instead (Monomer_r2SCAN3c_CPCM.inp, which
#   uses an explicit dielectric constant/refractive index rather than a
#   named solvent, so it does not depend on NMP being in any named list).
#
# Starting geometry: same idealized pyrrolidone-ring guess as
# Monomer_r2SCAN3c_CPCM.inp.

! XTB2 Opt

* xyz 0 1
